Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:04.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.27,0:02:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,a portal to the original body through the Sect Formation ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.17,0:02:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The two bodies can reunite anytime !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, I object !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:33.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,You clearly don't trust me !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(269,201)}2 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:47.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(362,490)\fad(300,000)}Wang Lin's avatar\N8th layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did it blow up again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the fifth time in 2 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will this ever work ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.95,0:02:53.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without good enough control over the Earth Fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the pill furnace explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the pill is also ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refining pills really is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, I think we should
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:04.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,just forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It blew up 5 times in 2 months !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you making it hard for yourself ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you continue, I will feed you to the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:20.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this ordeal will delay your cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Didn't your teacher tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,to consult your Grandteacher ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go ask her ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't like relying on others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,I prefer learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.55,0:03:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This will definitely succeed !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy will probably become
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,the first disciple of the Cloud Sky Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be expelled for destroying pill furnaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I made some pills yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,where are you going ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Southern Courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know the direction of the Southern Courtyard ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:27.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're an inner disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:29.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,why didn't you get a Spirit Beast ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister, Teacher is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The more I look at her, the prettier she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:40.68,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(367,459)\fad(300,300)}Cheng Xian\NEarly stage Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:44.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know Junior Sister Cheng Ling ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior doesn't like to be touched,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,what's your name ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:56.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm a disciple of the Southern Courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I saw that you were looking for directions,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:04:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,My name is Cheng Xian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I remember now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,you entered the sect 2 months ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,as the disciple of Master Zhou Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many people in the sect dream
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:18.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,of becoming Zhou Lin's disciple ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is he that good of an alchemist ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you have to promise me that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will introduce me to Junior Sister Cheng Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you won't speak, then forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother Wang...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,See ? I already called you Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just introduce me to her !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:45.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm really in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:46.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,why do people want to be Zhou Lin's disciple  ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because Zhou Lin has a good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the Cloud Sky Sect knows her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li of the Southern Courtyard is a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.41,0:06:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,She is one of the three rank 5 alchemists in the Cloud Sky Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they don't know that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li used to be a disciple of the Luo River Sect in the Burning Fire Country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as coincidences in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you Wang Lin ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:41.33,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(397,504)\fad(300,300)}Li Muwan\NCloud Sky Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:46.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,...but he couldn't have changed his aura to this extent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been apart for 200 years
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and my appearance is no longer that of Ma Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,She cannot recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:59.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Walking off the beaten path
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:03.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}through heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:06.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Before returning to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:10.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will refine this mortal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:15.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The left shore is the joyous laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:18.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The right shore is an eternal silence
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:25.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}lingering under the candlelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:28.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}To overturn this fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:28.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:32.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will walk against the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:35.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will even gather the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:34.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have some people to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:39.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}to illuminate the sky for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the past, she could barely complete a Heaven Separating Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now, she is an Elder who can make grade 5 pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:44.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}All this sadness was not meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:47.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}How many lives and deaths have passed in the blink of an eye ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:49.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:54.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}this chess game of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple's pill furnaces exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:07:59.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,They exploded ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must be because your spiritual energy rose too fast
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,so the Earth Fire is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:06.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a common mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,With some practice, you will get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're a disciple of Zhou Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give you this pill furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can fail 100 times with it without explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If after 100 tries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you still can't control your Earth Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,then it means you don't have the talent
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:27.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you should give up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to join the Outer Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Grandteacher. Junior will take take his leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:39.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ma Liang...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can someone have such a similar voice ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if there was,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's impossible for his facial expressions to be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if he really is him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,then why didn't his Divine Sense react at all ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I overthinking ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.77,0:09:18.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard from you a month ago that you were missing Dragon Mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I searched the entire country of Chu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and finally found one on the Suishi Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Senior Brother Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I have found a substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I refined the pill 3 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not valuable but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:34.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should keep it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:39.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not a direct disciple of the Ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only way for you to get high level pill recipes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,is by forming a cultivation pair with a direct disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:45.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You and I have known each other for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't you understand my feelings for you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Never mention it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:59.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestors have arranged our marriage already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:00.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This matter is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister, you'd better think about it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother, is everything alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:18.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must take the initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:20.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the Eastern Courtyard and find Junior Sister Cheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:23.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll call us a ride
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:24.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you don't get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Big Ape, Small Ape !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Spirit Apes are just like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,same vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:53.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Senior Brother Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:09.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the whole Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:12.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm the only person who can use Spirit Apes as mounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is water for refining pills made by my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I also use these two apes to brew spirit fruits into wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother, you're the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've ever given any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do I look ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:47.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's her, she's here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Help me set the stage
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that I can leave a good impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Were you looking for me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello Junior Sister Cheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm Cheng Xian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.95,0:12:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to be friends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.27,0:12:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you're just a low-rank disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.67,0:12:24.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,of being my friend ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:26.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,you just entered the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I give you guidance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will progress rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're just a low-rank disciple. Look at yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want to practice alchemy with you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:12:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't misunderstand !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shut up !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:10.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's just a low-rank alchemist...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could her teacher have given her such a powerful artifact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister, please listen to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:20.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go to hell !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:31.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Calm down,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you really want to kill him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:35.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:37.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teacher won't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this escalates, it won't benefit anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I get my hands on you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:46.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:53.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Her temper is a little bit explosive... right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:58.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,take this jade slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you ever need my help with anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't hesitate !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,after 93 tries...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You finally made it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:42.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Luckily the pill furnace didn't explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:44.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:52.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,here's the Foundation Pill recipe. Please take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you so polite ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every time we come, you prepare spirit fruits for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:00.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look how fat they got !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:03.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:08.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister Cheng asked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recently, this Junior Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:11.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,became very enthusiastic about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe she suddenly found out that I'm the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:25.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is a high grade pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your current skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:31.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,the success rate will be low.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:32.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:37.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at it in a positive way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:39.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,a step away from Foundation Establishment !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:42.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just need one pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll congratulate you early.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:57.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:20.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're catalysing the reaction !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:23.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master always has great ideas !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, I can reach Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on reaching Foundation Establishment !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(388,475)\fad(300,000)}Wang Lin's avatar\NPeak Late stage Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:40.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,in just a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:38.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You already progressed this much
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fast, but slower than my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, do you smell that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I smell some blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:57.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Big Ape ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:17:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The wound on his belly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,was obviously made by someone's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone took his Beast Core !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must have come here for help...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,It survived all the way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but died from exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,So Cheng Xian is in danger ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Should we save him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cheng Xian took care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:17.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not worth taking risks for Cheng Xian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:22.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And your cultivation is limited !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, what are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:21:08.41,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Wang Lin was able to absorb so many Foundation Pills at once thanks to the Ancient God Tactic. A normal cultivator would have exploded by consuming this many pills at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:05.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:09.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:15.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:15.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:20.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:20.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:24.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:30.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:30.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:35.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:35.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:39.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.81,0:19:39.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.81,0:19:43.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:47.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:55.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:55.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:20:03.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.81,0:20:03.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:10.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:10.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:20.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:20.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:41.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:41.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:49.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:49.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:58.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:58.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:21:06.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.25,0:21:06.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
